## Account lockout

`LOCKOUT_MAX_FAILURES` (5) wrong passwords in a row lock the account for
`LOCKOUT_MINUTES` (15). While locked, every sign-in answers 423
`account_locked` with the minutes left, whatever password was sent, so a
right guess is never confirmed. A successful sign-in or a password reset
clears the count. Together with rate limiting, guessing is slow per account
and per address.
